      "text": "30 complete task pairs, same model, same settings, only three switches apart:\n\n| Metric | Result |\n|---|---|\n| **Wall clock** | **0.505x** (about twice as fast; 26 of 30 pairs faster) |\n| **Output tokens** | **−42%** (16037 → 9380) |\n| **Reasoning characters** | **−51%** (42380 → 20872) |\n| **Task quality** | **438/438** checks green, 30/30 runs passing |"
    },
    {
      "section": "At a glance",
      "text": "All three switches plus the panel defaults is the fastest setting; the bolt alone, with the three newer switches off, is **0.823x** over the full 138-pair pool (18 % saved)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
