      "text": "- **Some tasks get slower — do not expect a win everywhere.** 1–5 step repairs and data reshaping do not repay the hint cost (`perfrefactor` 1.18x, `csvpipe` 1.12x); implementation-shaped tasks occasionally take one extra step (one 1.04x pair in DP20).\n- **Quality first.** In every accepted batch both arms produced identical hidden assertions; safety checks, destructive operations and accessibility paths always run the full validation.\n- **The switch is yours.** Only concise output is on by default; the three newer switches stay off because their payoff varies by task shape."
